+#if defined(DOOMO_PLATFORM_GBA)
+/* S3-CREDITS: a parade body's deadline on the GBA. Done in PC_STANDIN (4) ticks, a body's ~25 ms of slices made
+ * 6-12 ms frame extras for 6 of every 11 ticks (a rank = 2 bodies comes on every 11 ticks): frames of 34-45 ms, so 3 vblanks
+ * and a sprite governor that dropped every marcher. A rank is asked 11 ticks before it walks in, so each body can
